            "summary": "PYTHON W3Schools Jovian : DSA with Python MACHINE LEARNING Google's ML Crash&hellip;",
            "content_html": "\n    <h5 id=\"python\">\n      PYTHON\n    </h5>\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.w3schools.com/python\">W3Schools</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jovian.com/learn/data-structures-and-algorithms-in-python\">Jovian : DSA with Python</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n    <h5 id=\"machine-learning\">\n      MACHINE LEARNING\n    </h5>\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href = \"https://developers.google.com/machine-learning\">Google's ML Crash course is quite a gem</a></li>\n<li><a href = \"https://www.w3schools.com/python/python_ml_getting_started.asp\">W3Schools provides a less theoretical approach</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n    <h5 id=\"optimization\">\n      OPTIMIZATION\n    </h5>\n<div><ul>\n<li>BOYD and Vandenberg</li>\n<li><a href = \"https://projectcolabs.notion.site/Optimization-for-Machine-Learning-3c346c3609b58045a5eee1dcce69c6df?source=copy_link\">Optimization for Machine Learning by Vishal Vikram Parth</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n    <h5 id=\"statistics\">\n      STATISTICS\n    </h5>\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href = \"https://www.statlearning.com/\">ISLP</a></li>\n<li><a href = \"https://projectcolabs.notion.site/Statistics-Using-Python-Part-1-3c346c3609b58043b22bc71739e2129d?source=copy_link\">Statistics Using Python Part I by Kunal Rajpoot</a></li>\n<li><a href = \"https://projectcolabs.notion.site/Linear_Regression-cf546c3609b582acbd87812cdbbf4e9e?source=copy_link\">Linear and Logistic Regression by Lavanis Aravindam</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n\n    <h5 id=\"additional\">\n      Additional\n    </h5>\n<div><ul>\n<li><a href = \"https://projectcolabs.notion.site/Interview-questions-5e946c3609b58282b0cf81616253bd72?source=copy_link\">Interview Questions</a></li>\n</ul></div>",
